{
  "name": "Send service agreements after Stripe payment",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send service agreements after Stripe payment\n\nThis workflow listens for Stripe `checkout.session.completed`, sends a service agreement through VisiSign, provisions the customer after signing, and archives the signed PDF.\n\n### Tested path\n1. Send the sample Stripe-style payload below to the **Stripe Checkout Webhook** test URL.\n2. Confirm the IF node allows only `checkout.session.completed`.\n3. Confirm **Send Agreement via VisiSign** creates a signature request.\n4. Complete the request in VisiSign and confirm the completion branch runs.\n\n### Required setup\n- Install `n8n-nodes-visisign`.\n- Add VisiSign API credentials.\n- Add SMTP/email credentials.\n- In Stripe, subscribe this webhook to `checkout.session.completed`.\n- Store the agreement PDF URL and provisioning/archive URLs in Stripe Checkout Session metadata.\n\n### Sample test payload\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"checkout.session.completed\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"object\": {\n      \"id\": \"cs_test_1042\",\n      \"customer_details\": {\n        \"name\": \"Robert ONeill\",\n        \"email\": \"leasing@example.com\"\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"agreement_pdf_url\": \"https://api.visisign.app/samples/visisign-test-agreement.pdf\",\n        \"provision_url\": \"https://httpbin.org/post\",\n        \"archive_upload_url\": \"https://httpbin.org/put\",\n        \"sender_email\": \"welcome@example.com\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Overview and setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Stripe checkout event\n\nThe IF node blocks non-completion Stripe events. For production, configure Stripe to send only `checkout.session.completed` to this webhook.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Stripe checkout event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Provision customer\n\nAfter the agreement is signed, post the signer and signature request IDs to your provisioning endpoint. The sample payload uses `https://httpbin.org/post` for test execution.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Provision customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Archive PDF\n\nThe completed PDF is downloaded from VisiSign and PUT to the archive upload URL from Stripe metadata. Replace this with your storage provider native n8n node if preferred.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Archive signed agreement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        620
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "stripe-payment",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "allEntries",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Stripe Checkout Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        300,
        240
      ],
      "webhookId": "stripe-payment"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.type }}",
              "rightValue": "checkout.session.completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Verify Stripe Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        540,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "signatureRequest",
        "operation": "create",
        "title": "={{ 'Service Agreement — ' + $('Stripe Checkout Webhook').item.json.data.object.customer_details.name }}",
        "fileUrl": "={{ $(\"Stripe Checkout Webhook\").item.json.data.object.metadata.agreement_pdf_url }}",
        "signers": {
          "signer": [
            {
              "name": "={{ $('Stripe Checkout Webhook').item.json.data.object.customer_details.name }}",
              "email": "={{ $('Stripe Checkout Webhook').item.json.data.object.customer_details.email }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "message": "={{ 'Hi ' + $('Stripe Checkout Webhook').item.json.data.object.customer_details.name + ',\\n\\nThank you for your purchase! Please review and sign the service agreement to activate your account.' }}",
        "metadata": "={{ { provision_url: $(\"Stripe Checkout Webhook\").item.json.data.object.metadata.provision_url, archive_upload_url: $(\"Stripe Checkout Webhook\").item.json.data.object.metadata.archive_upload_url, authorization_header: $(\"Stripe Checkout Webhook\").item.json.data.object.metadata.authorization_header, sender_email: $(\"Stripe Checkout Webhook\").item.json.data.object.metadata.sender_email, login_url: $(\"Stripe Checkout Webhook\").item.json.data.object.metadata.login_url } }}"
      },
      "id": "c1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Send Agreement via VisiSign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-visisign.visiSign",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "visiSignApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "VisiSign API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "signature_request.completed"
      },
      "id": "c1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Agreement Signed Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-visisign.visiSignTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        540
      ],
      "webhookId": "visisign-agreement-done",
      "credentials": {
        "visiSignApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "VisiSign API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.signature_request.metadata.provision_url || \"https://httpbin.org/post\" }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ $json.signature_request.metadata.authorization_header || \"Bearer test-token\" }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.signature_request.signers[0].email }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.signature_request.signers[0].name }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "signature_request_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.signature_request.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Provision Customer Account",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        540,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $(\"Agreement Signed Trigger\").item.json.signature_request.metadata.sender_email || \"welcome@example.com\" }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Agreement Signed Trigger').item.json.signature_request.signers[0].email }}",
        "subject": "Your account is ready",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ \"Hi \" + $(\"Agreement Signed Trigger\").item.json.signature_request.signers[0].name + \",\\n\\nYour agreement has been signed and your account is now active.\" + ($(\"Agreement Signed Trigger\").item.json.signature_request.metadata.login_url ? \"\\n\\nLog in at: \" + $(\"Agreement Signed Trigger\").item.json.signature_request.metadata.login_url : \"\") + \"\\n\\nWelcome aboard!\" }}"
      },
      "id": "c1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Send Welcome Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        780,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "signatureRequest",
        "operation": "downloadFile",
        "requestId": "={{ $('Agreement Signed Trigger').item.json.signature_request.id }}"
      },
      "id": "c1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Download Signed Agreement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-visisign.visiSign",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        760
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "visiSignApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "VisiSign API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "={{ $(\"Agreement Signed Trigger\").item.json.signature_request.metadata.archive_upload_url || \"https://httpbin.org/put\" }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1b2c3d4-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Archive Signed Agreement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        780,
        760
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Stripe Checkout Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Verify Stripe Event",
